{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"SwiftNLP"}],"title":"Dense Local Text Embeddings with Accelerate"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/LocalEmbeddingEngine"],"anchor":"Embedding-APIs","title":"Embedding APIs"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Modern Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and semantic search systems require dense vector representations of text. Traditional approaches depend on remote APIs (e.g. OpenAI) or large multi-gigabyte models that exhaust memory. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftNLP"},{"type":"text","text":" introduces "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"},{"type":"text","text":", a subword N-gram character hashing projection engine that produces deterministic, unit-normalized dense embeddings in sub-millisecond execution times."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"1. Algorithmic Foundation","anchor":"1-Algorithmic-Foundation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"},{"type":"text","text":" operates through a three-stage mathematical pipeline:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Subword N-gram Hashing","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Text is tokenized into word and character n-grams (sizes 3 to 6). Each n-gram is hashed into a fixed integer space using FNV-1a hash functions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Dimension Projection","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Hashes are projected onto a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"D"},{"type":"text","text":"-dimensional vector space (e.g., "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"D = 128"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"D = 256"},{"type":"text","text":") with deterministic sign flips to prevent feature collision bias."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unit L2 Normalization","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The resulting dense vector is projected onto the unit hypersphere:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Formula:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"v_norm = v \/ ||v||_2 = v \/ sqrt(Σ v_i²)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because all embeddings have "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"||v||_2 = 1.0"},{"type":"text","text":", the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cosine Similarity"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" between two embeddings is equivalent to their direct "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dot Product"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", allowing single-instruction vector evaluation via Apple Accelerate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vDSP_dotprD"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Formula:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CosineSimilarity(u, v) = u · v"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"2. Generating Embeddings","anchor":"2-Generating-Embeddings"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftNLP","","\/\/ Initialize a 128-dimensional local embedding engine","let engine = LocalEmbeddingEngine(dimension: 128)","","\/\/ Generate embedding for a single text snippet","let vector = engine.embed(\"Apple Silicon M3 Max neural network processing\")","print(\"Vector dimension: \\(vector.count)\") \/\/ 128","","\/\/ Batch embedding generation","let documents = [","    \"High-performance computing on macOS\",","    \"Relational database wire protocol drivers\",","    \"Deep convolutional neural networks for vision\"","]","let batchEmbeddings = engine.embedBatch(documents)"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"3. Integration with SwiftCluster.VectorStore","anchor":"3-Integration-with-SwiftClusterVectorStore"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftCluster","","let store = VectorStore(metric: .cosineSimilarity)","","for (idx, doc) in documents.enumerated() {","    let vec = engine.embed(doc)","    store.add(id: \"doc_\\(idx)\", vector: vec, metadata: [\"text\": doc])","}","","\/\/ Perform instant semantic similarity search","let query = engine.embed(\"Mac hardware acceleration\")","let topHits = store.search(query: query, topK: 1)","print(\"Top match: \\(topHits.first?.metadata[\"text\"] ?? \"\")\")"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/denselocalembeddings"]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Generate high-dimensional, unit-normalized semantic embeddings 100% offline on Apple Silicon."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/DenseLocalEmbeddings","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Natural Language Processing, Text Feature Extraction & Native Apple NaturalLanguage Integration."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP","title":"SwiftNLP","role":"collection"},"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP/LocalEmbeddingEngine":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/localembeddingengine","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"LocalEmbeddingEngine","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lightweight, on-device dense text embedding generator optimized for Apple Silicon."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/LocalEmbeddingEngine"}}}